# Animation panel QA (G1.6, just qa-editor Tests/QA/animation-walkthrough.qa): in the Demo's Basic 3D scene, add an
# AnimationPlayer, create an animation, key a node's Position at 0 s and 1 s (the inspector's key button) and its
# Rotation, scrub to 0.5 s (the scene previews), undo a key, and capture the panel.
wait 40
open Examples/Demo/Assets/Scenes/basic_3d.mfscene
wait 20
add-node AnimationPlayer Player
wait 3
select Player
wait 5
command anim.new
wait 3
anim-key Ring Position
anim-key Ring RotationDegrees
anim-scrub 1
set-node Ring Position 0,3,0
anim-key Ring Position
set-node Ring RotationDegrees 0,90,0
anim-key Ring RotationDegrees
anim-scrub 0.5
wait 10
state
capture 01-animation-panel
command anim.play
wait 30
capture 02-animation-playing
command anim.stop
key Z cmd
wait 5
state
capture 03-animation-undone
quit
